cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below and cite the HEAPO dataset separately."
title: "HEAPO Uncertainty-Aware Multi-Horizon Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python pipeline for probabilistic multi-horizon forecasting
  of air-source and ground-source heat-pump electricity demand using HEAPO,
  including conformal calibration, household-level validation, bootstrap
  inference, virtual portfolios, and peak-management scenarios.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-10
authors:
  - name: "HEAPO forecasting study contributors"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - heat pump
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - conformal prediction
  - demand response
  - LightGBM
  - Temporal Fusion Transformer
